# needs-native-review: the team's move to the final conversation, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "applicant onboarding: finalAdded"
msgid "The final conversation is open. The applicant books it now, and their proposal is fixed."
msgstr "La conversación final está abierta. La persona que postula la reserva ahora, y su propuesta queda fija."

# needs-native-review: the team's move to the final conversation, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "applicant onboarding: finalExists"
msgid "The final conversation is already open."
msgstr "La conversación final ya está abierta."

# needs-native-review: the team's move to the final conversation, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "applicant onboarding: finalTalksFirst"
msgid "Write up the conversations before it first. Then move the application to the final conversation."
msgstr "Primero escriba las conversaciones anteriores. Después pase la postulación a la conversación final."

# needs-native-review: the move to the final conversation only once References and proposal is done, QA round 4
msgctxt "applicant onboarding: finalAtReferences"
msgid "The final conversation comes once References and proposal is done: the application shortlisted, its conversations written up, and each reference given and followed up."
msgstr "La conversación final llega cuando Referencias y propuesta está completa: la postulación preseleccionada, sus conversaciones escritas y cada referencia entregada y contactada."

